{"duration_api_ms":200758,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"65e9752e-fe6d-4bf5-83d5-8aebac643e3c","total_cost_usd":0.244544,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12620,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":19406,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":13747},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12620,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":19406,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12620,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12620},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":19406,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":12620,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.244544,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":13747,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"Feasible designs cluster at D 3.0-3.3 m, cone angle 58-70 deg, flight-path angle (FPA) -2.6 to -3.7 deg. Both front members sit at cone 70, bluntness 1.15-1.2. In normalised hypervolume, 1 K of bondline temperature is worth about 4-5x as much as 10 kW/m2 of heat flux. So the priority is pushing temperature down at the corner where the g and heatshield-mass-fraction limits bind, plus a few spread points along the front.\",\"evidence\":[\"Max g is about 12 (margin 0.1307 at 10.431 g). It depends mainly on FPA and only weakly on D (about +0.4 g/m). At D 3.2 it is 11.606 at -3.4, 11.767 at -3.5, 11.93 at -3.6 (C-c008895a843b), and 12.074 at -3.7 (C-b4d38376e9e5, infeasible). Feasible FPA is therefore limited to about -3.55 to -3.6 at D near 3.3-3.4.\",\"Mass-fraction margin falls about 0.028 per 0.05 m of D at cone 70: 0.134 at D 3.15, 0.108 at 3.2, 0.077 at 3.25, 0.050 at 3.3 (C-b4d38376e9e5, C-c601def705b2, C-91b1001a3715, C-6041504dc2c9). Extrapolating, D up to about 3.38 stays feasible. Margin is independent of FPA (C-5240f037226d, C-477b380312b9, C-1645b8970ef0).\",\"Bondline temperature falls with steeper FPA at about 12.5 K/deg (C-5240f037226d 410.9 K at -2.6, C-477b380312b9 399.9 K at -3.5). Larger D and higher bluntness/cone also lower it (C-6041504dc2c9 395.8 K is the lowest feasible). Heat flux falls with larger D and bluntness, and rises with steeper FPA.\",\"Geometry failures (12 of 40, e.g. C-f46ea12b9a86 at bluntness 1.3, cone 70, and C-77238b231f4a, C-c170e00795a8) fit a rule I inferred from the data: bluntness must stay below (0.5-0.1(1-cos a))/cos a, which is about 1.27 at 70 deg. Bluntness 1.25 at cone 70 was valid (C-c601def705b2). The rule does not depend on D, so I keep bluntness at or below 1.25 at cone 70.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Peak deceleration occurs higher in the atmosphere when the ballistic coefficient is low. A larger D and a blunter, wider cone give lower stagnation heating and less integrated heat, so a lower bondline temperature. A steeper entry shortens the heating pulse and lowers temperature, but raises peak g. Heatshield mass fraction caps D (about 3.38 m), and g caps FPA (about -3.55 to -3.6). The best region is therefore the corner D about 3.35-3.39, bluntness 1.25, cone 70, FPA about -3.55, with lower-heat-flux points spread out at shallower FPA. The linear sensitivities used for predictions were fitted from the 40 rows, and the geometry rule was inferred from the data.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The mass-fraction margin at D 3.36-3.39 is extrapolated and may be convex in D, so the D 3.38-3.39 points could be infeasible. The g margin at FPA -3.55 to -3.58 is only 0.3-0.8%, so one or two of these may fail. The bluntness and cone effects on temperature are confounded in the existing data. Predicted values come from local linear fits and may be off by a few K and about 5-10 kW/m2.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"Corner design: near the maximum D at bluntness 1.25 and cone 70, FPA near the g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":291000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Most likely to lower temperature below 395.8 K and extend the front's low-temperature end. Its g margin is about 0.7% and its mass margin about 0.01.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly smaller D for a safer mass-fraction margin at the same FPA.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":294000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Robust improvement over C-6041504dc2c9, with a mass margin of about 0.03.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"Test the D limit with a moderate FPA that leaves g margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.39,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the mass-fraction boundary near D 3.39 while g is safe.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"Intermediate D with a slightly steeper FPA.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.56},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":292500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the g and mass margins in the middle of the corner region.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"D 3.38 with FPA just short of the estimated g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":291500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes the g limit at large D. Predicted g is about 11.955, close to the 12 limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"D 3.37, near the maximum, with a slightly safer FPA.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.37,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":292500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills in the D sensitivity between 3.35 and 3.38.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly smaller D with a steeper FPA; the g-versus-D trade shows steeper FPA at smaller D is feasible.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.34,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":297000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the FPA gain outweighs the D loss near the g boundary.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"D 3.32 with the steepest FPA I expect to be feasible.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.32,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":299000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the D versus FPA trade-off along the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"Test bluntness 1.25 versus 1.2 at nearly the same D and FPA as C-6041504dc2c9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":300400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Isolates the bluntness and FPA effect at D 3.3, with predicted g about 11.94.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"Bluntness sensitivity at large D: lower bluntness gives a mass-margin and geometry check.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.15,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":300000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Separates the bluntness effect from the D effect. Bluntness 1.15 gives a slightly different mass margin.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-91b1001a3715\",\"rationale\":\"Moderate FPA (-3.3) at large D: a mid-front point with lower flux.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":284000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds a non-dominated mid-front point with comfortable g margin (about 11.4).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-91b1001a3715\",\"rationale\":\"Mid-front point at FPA -3.0 and large D.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":277700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the front toward lower flux at moderate temperature.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-91b1001a3715\",\"rationale\":\"Improve C-91b1001a3715 (FPA -2.6) with larger D and bluntness 1.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":268000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Would dominate C-91b1001a3715 (285.9 kW/m2, 407.6 K) if the D and bluntness gains hold.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-91b1001a3715\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow-entry point for the low-heat-flux end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":261000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the front toward lower flux. The flux and temperature slopes are extrapolated from -2.6.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-91b1001a3715\",\"rationale\":\"Shallower entry (-2.0), to find how low the flux can go.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":254000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the extrapolation to shallow entry. There may be a minimum where the entry becomes longer and the temperature rises steeply.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-91b1001a3715\",\"rationale\":\"Very shallow entry (-1.7) as the low-flux extreme of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":247000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks whether lower flux is still non-dominated at higher temperature, and tests the model far from the data.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c601def705b2\",\"rationale\":\"Steeper FPA at D 3.2 (bluntness 1.25, cone 70), where the geometry is proven valid.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":306000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the g limit at D 3.25. Predicted g is about 11.95, and the mass margin is about 0.08.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c601def705b2\",\"rationale\":\"Mid-D design at moderate FPA, with the high mass margin of D 3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":298000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Low-risk local point that adds data on the D and FPA slopes.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6114845e41e8\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly lower bluntness (1.1) at large D and steep FPA, to measure the bluntness effect on temperature.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":298000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Clarifies whether bluntness or cone angle drives the temperature and mass-margin gains.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6041504dc2c9\",\"rationale\":\"Nearly identical to the parent, with D 3.3, to add a FPA-only step: -3.45 with bluntness 1.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gives a safer-g point at the D limit, to separate the mass-margin question from the g margin.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":155072,"type":"result","duration_ms":200837,"uuid":"35d55a08-8c53-4efc-8129-3d0be8802fd4","ttft_stream_ms":1277,"time_to_request_ms":85,"first_content_frame_ms":1278,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
